146
00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:58.300
Nii ja teisele ka.

147
00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:01.209
Ja see on just selleks

148
00:09:01.309 --> 00:09:04.510
Et need keeled

149
00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.820
Oleks sellest pesulõksust eemal.
Nii.

150
00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.579
Ma veel nii palju aru ei saa,
